{
  "apiVersion": "authentik.weebo.io/v1alpha1",
  "kind": "AuthentikApplication",
  "scope": "Namespaced",
  "description": "Mirrors `authentik_application` + its `protocol_provider`. Namespaced —\nowned by whichever team/namespace created it, governed by\n`AuthentikNamespacePolicy`.",
  "properties": {
    "instanceRef": {
      "description": "Name of an `AuthentikInstance` CR.",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "metaIcon": {
      "nullable": true,
      "type": "string"
    },
    "name": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "provider": {
      "description": "`oauth2`/`proxy` are implemented in v1 (both are in real use in the\nTerraform module being replaced — `longhorn.tf` uses `proxy`).\n`saml`/`ldap` are schema-only stubs: accepted by the schema so a future\naddition isn't a breaking change, but rejected by the reconciler with\nan explicit error, never silently ignored. See `.prompt/plan.md`\ndecision 2.\n\nDeliberately **not** a Rust sum type (`enum Foo { Oauth2(..),\nProxy(..) }`) even though that's what it conceptually is: kube-core's\nCRD schema generation cannot merge an internally-tagged enum whose\nvariants carry different literal discriminator values — each variant's\n`kind` property gets a different `enum: [...]` schema and\n`CustomResourceExt::crd()` panics (\"Property 'kind' ... must be\nidentical\"). This flat-struct-plus-discriminator shape is the standard\nkube.rs workaround; \"exactly one of `oauth2`/`proxy` set, matching\n`kind`\" is validated by the reconciler, not the schema.",
      "properties": {
        "kind": {
          "enum": [
            "oauth2",
            "proxy",
            "saml",
            "ldap"
          ],
          "type": "string"
        },
        "oauth2": {
          "nullable": true,
          "properties": {
            "allowedRedirectUris": {
              "default": [],
              "items": {
                "properties": {
                  "matchingMode": {
                    "enum": [
                      "strict",
                      "regex"
                    ],
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "url": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "matchingMode",
                  "url"
                ],
                "type": "object"
              },
              "type": "array"
            },
            "authorizationFlow": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "clientId": {
              "nullable": true,
              "type": "string"
            },
            "grantTypes": {
              "default": [],
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "type": "array"
            },
            "invalidationFlow": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "propertyMappings": {
              "default": [],
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "type": "array"
            },
            "signingKey": {
              "nullable": true,
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "authorizationFlow",
            "invalidationFlow"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        "proxy": {
          "nullable": true,
          "properties": {
            "authorizationFlow": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "externalHost": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "internalHost": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "invalidationFlow": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "outpostRef": {
              "description": "`None` => attach to Authentik's embedded outpost by name (default,\nmatches current `longhorn.tf` behavior). `Some(name)` => must\nresolve to an `AuthentikOutpost` CR.",
              "nullable": true,
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "authorizationFlow",
            "externalHost",
            "internalHost",
            "invalidationFlow"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "kind"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "slug": {
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "instanceRef",
    "name",
    "provider",
    "slug"
  ],
  "type": "object"
}
